description	"Darth Krayt

A relentless dual-wielding warlord clad in living Vonduun crab armor.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- Cripples And Pulls On Hit
-- 20% Faster Swing Speed
- Dual Lightsabers (Dual/Red Style)
-- Saber Defense (3)
-- Blaster Defense/Deflect (2)
-- Saber Damage (100)
-- Ignites/Cripples/Staggers On Hit
-- Saber Throw (2)

^5Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (3)
- Dark Transfer (Drain 3) ^3[CS3]
- Lightning (1)
- Grip (2)
- Sense (1)

^8Attributes:
